  "prompt": "Yara, who runs retail operations, is renewing the maintenance contract for the Dutch stores and asks which stores the contract must cover: every physical store in the Netherlands that is still open. From the stores table, keep the stores whose country_code is 'NL', whose store_type is not 'web' (so the webshop is left out) and whose close_date is missing, because a store that has closed has a close_date. Return five columns, in this order: store_id, store_code, city, store_type and opened_on, with one row per store. Sort by store_type from A to Z; when stores have the same store_type, sort them by store_id from low to high.",
